stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> REQUESTED: User initiates analysis
    REQUESTED --> VALIDATING: Rate limit & token check
    VALIDATING --> QUEUED: Validated, job dispatched
    
    state ProcessingState {
        QUEUED --> CV_EXTRACTION: Download image & compute redness/texture
        CV_EXTRACTION --> FUSION_CALCULATION: Weighted combination of modalities
        FUSION_CALCULATION --> KNOWLEDGE_RETRIEVAL: Top-5 pgvector classical chunks
        KNOWLEDGE_RETRIEVAL --> AI_SYNTHESIS: GPT-4o grounded completion
        AI_SYNTHESIS --> SAFETY_FILTER: Patch test & non-diagnostic checks
    }

    SAFETY_FILTER --> COMPLETED: Snapshot persisted in scan_results
    
    ProcessingState --> FAILED: Hard error / timeout (>45s)
    ProcessingState --> RETRYING: Transient 5xx / rate-limit backoff
    RETRYING --> ProcessingState: Retry attempt <= 3
    RETRYING --> RETRY_EXHAUSTED: Retries exceeded

    FAILED --> [*]
    RETRY_EXHAUSTED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
